.TH QUADRF-MIMO 1 "October 2026" "QuadRF" "QuadRF"
.SH NAME
quadrf-mimo \- phase-coded 4x4 MIMO link and telemetry server
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B quadrf-mimo
.BR serve " | " cli
[\fIoptions\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Runs a phase-coded 4x4 MIMO TDD transceiver across the four QuadRF antenna
elements and serves live channel, constellation, spectrum, and chat telemetry
over WebSockets.
.PP
The control panel Launch button and the desktop icon both start
.B quadrf-mimo.service
and open
.IR /mimo/ ,
which nginx proxies to port 8091. Closing the last tab stops the service.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI --port " N"
Listen address
.BR http://0.0.0.0:N .
Default: 8091.
.TP
.BI --web " DIR"
Directory of static files. Default:
.IR /usr/share/quadrf/mimo .
.TP
.BI --state " FILE"
Persistent settings file. Default:
.IR /var/lib/quadrf-mimo/settings.conf .
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /usr/share/quadrf/mimo
Installed browser client.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR quadrf-phasegaze (1),
.BR quadrf-jtag (1),
.BR quadrf-app (8)
